From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: docker-mirakc-edcb <docker-mirakc-edcb@localhost>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 02:42:31 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Bound the copies into the response buffers

The response header was copied into a 512-byte array and the body of
/api/channels into a 128 KiB buffer without checking the length, so a
long header or a large channel list (Mirakurun includes the services of
every channel) overflowed them.

- Copy the header only while it fits; fail the request otherwise.
- Grow the body buffer as needed, up to 16 MiB; fail beyond that.
- Fail on a response without a status line instead of dereferencing
  NULL, and report response code 0 when none was received.
---
 src/BonDriver_LinuxMirakc.cpp |   9 ++-
 src/http_proc.hpp             | 134 +++++++++++++++++++++++++---------
 2 files changed, 107 insertions(+), 36 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/BonDriver_LinuxMirakc.cpp b/src/BonDriver_LinuxMirakc.cpp
